# Optional "Translate & Dub" feature. Installed into a SEPARATE venv (.venv-dub) because
# chatterbox-tts pins numpy<2 / transformers==5.2.0, which conflict with the main app.
# Install:  setup_dub.bat (installs requirements-dub.txt, the lock with hashes made from this file;
# the command that makes it is at the top of requirements-dub.txt).
#
# chatterbox-tts itself is installed with --no-deps by setup_dub.bat to skip its demo-only
# gradio dependency; the runtime deps it needs are listed here explicitly.
